#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:3
#: 054dfff196334c64b2b382aea09c1107
msgid "成分空间采样（Composition Space Sampling）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:5
#: 97c6dfd0f0d04c9fb9980e0cdb211b6d
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:7
#: 9b205b7b093f42ee81a64004ac7f9c7f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:9
#: 5c6162d4e3e24347a9b300fb6f113e73
msgid ""
"在元素池和元数约束下生成成分设计空间。对选定元素集合按二元到五元组合展开，用"
"网格或 Sobol 低差异序列在 simplex 上采样目标配比点，输出带 `Comp(...)` 标签的"
"结构副本。本卡只生成目标配比计划，不真正落位——需要下游接 `Random Occupancy` "
"才能得到离散原子占位。"
msgstr ""
"Generate a composition design space from an element pool and selected "
"component counts. The card expands binary through quinary combinations and "
"samples target fractions on each simplex with a grid or Sobol sequence. It "
"outputs structure copies labeled `Comp(...)`; these labels are composition "
"plans, not actual site occupations. Follow with `Random Occupancy` to assign "
"discrete species."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:11
#: 1bc9a203a4c54c1f8cc4dc22dbb8f2d0
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:13
#: 4510641d03fa44adb8f6fb9fd1724849
msgid ""
"这张卡采样的是成分单纯形，而不是直接替换原子。对 $K$ 种元素，目标成分满足"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:15
#: ddacc8ef69e44d36b30a1a1790689118
msgid ""
"\n"
"x_e\\ge x_{\\min},\\qquad \\sum_{e=1}^{K}x_e=1.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:19
#: 2b8b030e4d4843758263468dafb994e7
msgid ""
"`网格`模式在这个约束面上枚举规则点；`Sobol`模式把低差异序列映射到同一约束面，"
"适合在 有限预算下更均匀地覆盖高维成分空间。输出只把目标 $x_e$ 写入 "
"`Comp(...)` 标签，元素占位 仍与输入相同；要得到真实化学结构，必须再接`随机占"
"位`。预算分配会在每个输入结构之间回流 未用完名额，因此“最大输出数”是全流程上"
"限，不保证每个输入得到相同数量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:24
#: a7d17afaf3494e8193b29ff1c39c8af0
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:26
#: 1c2e6bc98074454887721f78644456d2
msgid "场景：模型在偏离训练集化学计量比时预测崩了"
msgstr "Scenario: Predictions fail away from the training stoichiometry"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:28
#: 16642240dff4453fa8092d56e3f8c061
msgid ""
"你在 Co-Cr-Ni 三元系上训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练数据全部来自等摩尔 CoCrNi 单"
"相。模型对等摩尔构型的能量和力预测很好，但一跑 Co30Cr20Ni50 这种偏离等摩尔的"
"组分，能量误差翻了三倍。诊断结果是：训练集所有数据的成分落在 simplex 的一个点"
"上，模型根本没有见过成分变化导致的局域化学环境差异。"
msgstr ""
"A Co-Cr-Ni NEP is trained entirely on equiatomic CoCrNi. It performs well "
"there, but its energy error triples at a composition such as Co30Cr20Ni50. "
"All training compositions occupy one point of the simplex, so composition-"
"dependent local chemistry is extrapolated."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:30
#: 088914372a6742fca06f90eb1606ff07
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 合金模型的基本要求是能在整个成分空间内插，而不是只记住一个成分"
"点。如果训练集成分覆盖太窄，模型只能外推——成分漂得越远，误差越大。解决办法是"
"先在目标成分空间内均匀撒一批配比点，再去下游逐个落位，让模型从头学起不同成分"
"下的化学环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** An alloy model should interpolate across the intended "
"composition domain, not memorize one composition. First design a well-"
"distributed set of target fractions, then realize each target with "
"downstream site occupation so the training set contains distinct chemical "
"environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:32
#: 6c186950851a42f29ca01490af594ea0
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 CoCrNi 超胞结构（当前训练集里唯一的结构，等摩尔配比）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A relaxed equiatomic CoCrNi supercell, currently the only "
"training composition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:34
#: 875509f2bed54e488138bf2eb583ff64
msgid ""
"**目标：** 从 Co-Cr-Ni 三个元素出发，生成二元 + 三元所有配比的网格采样，约 "
"500 个目标配比点，后续接 `Random Occupancy` 落地"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Grid-sample all binary and ternary Co-Cr-Ni combinations up "
"to about 500 targets, then realize them with `Random Occupancy`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:36
#: bfa8f0e8bfc94aaa946a8dec58315db1
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:37
#: 561390c684884d0c8d5e131ddf1fe271
msgid "`元素`（`elements`） = `Co,Cr,Ni`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:38
#: fdf9f56aa12e4ddebd6971357988e525
msgid "`组合元数`（`order`） = `2,3` （二元 + 三元组合）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:39
#: 9644b02446284b87857053bb5744b440
msgid "`采样方法`（`method`） = `Grid`，`成分步长`（`step`） = `0.1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:40
#: ac57f59155fe439ba23812b280817a9d
msgid "`每个输入的最大目标成分数`（`max_outputs`） = `500`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:42
#: 5dc41f50228c48488146342761a4102c
msgid ""
"**输出：** 约 500 个带 `Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)` 标签的结构副本。此时结构"
"内原子种类未变，标签只是目标配比计划"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** About 500 structure copies labeled `Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)`. "
"Atomic species are unchanged at this stage; the label records only the "
"target composition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:44
#: 3a7f6a688165479c849accb506d1adf9
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:45
#: 9416b88e974a4397ae1c746b309e68e6
msgid "重训后跑几个偏移等摩尔的测试组分，力的 MAE 应该不再随成分漂移而显著恶化"
msgstr ""
"After realization, labeling, and retraining, force MAE at several off-"
"equiatomic tests should no longer deteriorate sharply with composition "
"distance."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:46
#: 2a0cd4fa6934458a854e7800c7e3d450
msgid ""
"检查 `Config_type` 中 Comp 标签的成分分布是否覆盖了 simplex 各区域——如果某些"
"边角空白，减小 step 或换 Sobol 补点"
msgstr ""
"Plot the `Comp` fractions from `Config_type` and confirm coverage across "
"each simplex. Reduce the grid step or use Sobol if corners or regions remain "
"empty."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:47
#: f1841b10afb2412c9f8b64aafd13d105
msgid ""
"如果全部集中等摩尔附近但没有边角覆盖，打开 `包含边界成分点`"
"（`include_endpoints`），降低 `元素最小占比`（`min_fraction`）到 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:48
#: 3737487e9851404c8114af4c4bbaadd7
msgid ""
"如果输出量不够覆盖所有 order 组合，提高 `每个输入的最大目标成分数`"
"（`max_outputs`），或把 `输出预算分配`（`budget_mode`）换成 `Capacity-"
"weighted` 让高元数组合分到更多名额"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:50
#: 5a73ff7694544df6a449721b8a70dc84
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:52
#: c57f936215214deea71b1426d8b4ea12
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:53
#: 9fb0ddf7cfc54e2f8aca7ce97830aebd
msgid "模型在偏离训练集化学计量比时误差显著增大"
msgstr "Model error grows markedly away from the training stoichiometry"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:54
#: 63e44f946b984a4e9d70755f3ba057d0
msgid "需要系统覆盖二元到多元合金成分空间，而非少量随机掺杂"
msgstr "A binary-to-multicomponent composition space needs systematic coverage"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:55
#: 75133a663f5c40d592c278856678d2c3
msgid "作为合金 pipeline 的第一步，先定义配比，再接占位卡片"
msgstr "An alloy workflow needs target fractions before site occupation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:57
#: fe46cdee29c84c929fbf4373b209274b
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:58
#: 57adf0dd1c6246afbdf3b82590ca1b77
msgid "只需单一固定化学计量比的结构"
msgstr "Only one fixed stoichiometry is needed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:59
#: 62a4009deb25498eb40530cd049e87ea
msgid "已经有明确掺杂规则且不需要扫配比空间 → 直接用 `Random Doping`"
msgstr ""
"A specific doping rule is already known and no composition scan is needed; "
"use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:60
#: f270863cc92b4218aed141f5f59ea0f0
msgid "需要增补的是同一成分下的不同原子排布 → 直接用 `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""
"Only atomic arrangements at one composition are missing; use `Random "
"Occupancy`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:62
#: c27963cd98704b4f9548c85d5aca601f
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:64
#: 0682f2e8f6404a6995c0468f6b3a88aa
msgid "元素（elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:66
#: a0e855cfbcf045878f1b429d77d18548
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Co,Cr,Ni`。逗号分隔的元素列表，如 `Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`。至少需要 2 "
"个元素，程序会从中取出所有 n 元组合做配比扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Co,Cr,Ni`. Comma-separated element pool, for example "
"`Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`. At least two elements are required; the card forms all "
"requested n-component subsets."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:68
#: f6787d4a97da44aa9b7d60b0eb005958
msgid "组合元数（order）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:70
#: 487c022fcf1c4f17a4473fdffbff1320
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `2,3,4,5`。决定采样二元、三元、四元或五元成分空间。界面用“二元"
"（2）”“二元 + 三元（2,3）”等易读名称显示，保存时仍使用 `2`、`2,3` 等稳定值。"
"也兼容旧版名称如 `Binary`、`Ternary+Quaternary`。当候选元素不足时，不可执行的"
"元数会自动跳过。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:72
#: 31ef13d93d27489f945e925f0831dc2e
msgid "采样方法（method）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:74
#: b73da8b28f11416b980984184b469fc1
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Grid`。`Grid` 用均匀网格采样，步长可控，适合低元数（2-3 元）。"
"`Sobol` 用低差异序列在高维 simplex 上覆盖更均匀，适合 4-5 元或点数有限的情"
"况。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Grid`. `Grid` uses a controlled uniform step and is "
"convenient for binary or ternary spaces. `Sobol` gives more even limited-"
"point coverage of four- or five-component simplexes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:76
#: c27ceba654fe43868de853317641b0a0
msgid "成分步长（step）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:78
#: d8cc1c85d90e456799bb08633ecbe9a8
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.1，仅 Grid 模式生效。单位是成分分数，`0.1` 表示 10 个百分点。"
"数值越小，网格越密、目标配比越多；典型值为 0.05-0.15。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:80
#: f1fb585f275e4b4b95f549b72c7cb32a
msgid "每种元素组合的采样点数（n_points）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:82
#: 043baeffa4e1494dba832eb9c7829018
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 50，仅 Sobol 模式生效。它表示每一种元素组合通过 `元素最小占比`"
"（`min_fraction`）约束后的目标有效点数，而不是过滤前的尝试数。operation 会继"
"续补采样直到得到该数量；典型值为 25-200。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:84
#: 7782bbc85a3c4431a77bd62bc49aeaed
msgid "元素最小占比（min_fraction）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:86
#: 1390e1d5b6ac4e6b9945e53d4a22540a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0，范围 0-1。每个元素的最小占比下限。比如设为 0.05 意味着每个"
"组分至少 5%，极端稀释的端点成分会被自动过滤掉。设 0 则不做下限约束。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`, range 0-1. Minimum fraction of every included "
"element. A value of 0.05 removes compositions below 5%; zero imposes no "
"lower bound."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:88
#: e321824fad424bddbd3d8fdc1c8e484e
msgid "包含边界成分点（include_endpoints）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:90
#: 819d9798d4874bec8600b07319033e12
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true，仅 Grid 模式。勾选后保留纯元素端点和某个元素占比为零的边界"
"成分；关掉后只保留所有元素占比均大于零的内部点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:92
#: c076c7febabe4fd6b917e93546a07812
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:94
#: bdf348afd42442c6a374c8e2e11086a4
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径（Sobol 生成和组合选取），同参数同输入"
"可复现。对比实验时打开，探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Fix Sobol generation and combination selection for "
"reproducible controlled comparisons."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:96
#: 4523b90937674bb98cd6db252886e862
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:98
#: 45cc696f8141465ab48e998152ebe04f
msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的采样分布。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Different values produce different sample designs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:100
#: 2b4c04c0361c4a7db9944da0b768d6d2
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:102
#: 817f8cdab9964fb9956c5126623ad3fd
msgid "每个输入的最大目标成分数（max_outputs）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:104
#: 0d1ed37eb9d0499fa6eebdf26d0b50a3
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 500。限制每个输入结构生成的目标配比总数，防止组合爆炸。超出预算时"
"按 `输出预算分配`（`budget_mode`）规则分配到各组合元数；典型值为 250-1500。"
msgstr ""

