#: 09addd210433474e8dba40d40bd71e4c
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy`：先定义目标配比，再落到离散"
"原子占位。合金 pipeline 的标准起手式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:182
#: cb547707944441bd892e7ecc9f3c963f
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：配比覆"
"盖 + 占位多样性 + 额外局部替位。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:183
#: 81e033d3dec240fba5df30108d607d05
msgid ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy` → `Atomic Perturb`：成分 + "
"占位 + 坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:185
#: f87f91f69c5d4fa687140b8fcf3e8c40
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:187
#: 8a7eee9be0064589a4d310ad4bce9209
msgid ""
"**输出和输入完全一样。** `元素`（`elements`）少于 2 个元素，或 `组合元数`"
"（`order`）不合法，或 `每个输入的最大目标成分数`（`max_outputs`） <= 0。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:189
#: 67b2058b9dc7483abc2ecf0f62a33476
msgid ""
"**标签成分和原子实际组成不一致。** 正常——Composition Space Sampling 只写目标"
"配比标签，不改原子种类。需要接 `Random Occupancy` 才会真正替换原子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:191
#: 0b34c041acb140f6b9abf8134ffa3e41
msgid ""
"**组合爆炸。** 5 元 + Grid + step=0.05 可产生上万个点。先用 `每个输入的最大目"
"标成分数`（`max_outputs`）卡住上限，小样本验证后再放量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:193
#: 971b14ad4dc74eafb579547759417801
msgid ""
"**某些 order 没有输出。** 检查 `输出预算分配`（`budget_mode`）分配和 element "
"数量。只有 3 个元素但 order 含 4 和 5 时，程序自动跳过不可执行的组合。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:195
#: ca497557813d4ebc9fc9281145a68115
msgid ""
"**Sobol + min_fraction 报告有效点不足。** 下限越接近等摩尔值 `1/order`，可接"
"受区域越小。operation 会在明确的尝试预算内补采样；仍不足时抛出 `ValueError`，"
"报告实际接受点数、目标点数和尝试次数，不会静默返回少量结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Sobol + min_fraction reports too few valid points.** The closer the lower "
"bound is to the equimolar value `1/order`, the smaller the admissible region "
"becomes. The operation resamples within an explicit attempt budget. If the "
"target is still not reached, it raises `ValueError` with the accepted count, "
"target count, and attempt count instead of silently returning a small "
"dataset."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:197
#: e21c7ff4f5134f2f946529028184b14e
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:199
#: a5807bd5dd1945618803cc5f8f690164
msgid ""
"`Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 格式。每个输出结构通过 `Config_type` 携"
"带目标配比。"
msgstr ""
"Format: `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)`. Each output carries its "
"target fractions in `Config_type`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:201
#: e8336107aaf14c899de0f3086f2e970a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:203
#: cbeacba96c014b0e9b0efe800513161c
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入顺序"
"可复现。Grid 模式的网格点本身是确定性的，`使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）主要影响"
"组合选取顺序和 Sobol 生成。"
msgstr ""

